  1863                              <1> rawend:
  1864                              <1> RAWSIZE equ     (rawend-tstart+1FFh) & ~1FFh
  1865 000008AC 00<rep 154h>        <1>         times   (-(rawend-tstart)) & 1FFh db 0
  1866                              <1> 
  1867                              <1> ; ---- the interpreter's variables, after the code (zero at the start) -------
  1868                              <1> ; They are in the zeros that pad the section to its FileAlignment, or past
  1869                              <1> ; them in the uninitialised part: within 127 bytes of `next` either way.
  1870                              <1>         absolute rawend
